value.XON_SATURATION.0.60=60% (Natural)
value.XON_SATURATION.0.70=70% (Default)
value.XON_SATURATION.0.80=80% (Rich)
value.XON_SATURATION.0.90=90% (Vivid)
value.XON_SATURATION.1.00=100% (Full)
value.XON_SATURATION.1.20=120% (Extra Vivid)
value.XON_SATURATION.1.40=140% (Max Boost)
option.XON_CONTRAST=Image Contrast
option.XON_CONTRAST.comment=Fine-tunes tonal contrast between lights and darks without clipping highlights or crushing shadows. Default: 100%.
value.XON_CONTRAST.0.85=85% (Soft)
value.XON_CONTRAST.0.92=92% (Gentle)
value.XON_CONTRAST.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_CONTRAST.1.08=108% (Crisp)
value.XON_CONTRAST.1.15=115% (Punchy)
value.XON_CONTRAST.1.25=125% (High Contrast)
option.XON_SHARPNESS=Image Sharpness (CAS)
option.XON_SHARPNESS.comment=Contrast-Adaptive Sharpening enhances fine block textures, stonework, and distant edges without halo artifacts. Default: Off (0%) in Native mode, automatic in Boost modes.
value.XON_SHARPNESS.0.00=Off (Default)
value.XON_SHARPNESS.0.15=15% (Subtle)
value.XON_SHARPNESS.0.25=25% (Crisp)
value.XON_SHARPNESS.0.40=40% (Sharp)
value.XON_SHARPNESS.0.60=60% (Ultra Sharp)
option.XON_HAND_LIGHT=Dynamic Held Light
option.XON_HAND_LIGHT.comment=Casts warm local light around you when holding a torch, lantern, glowstone, or other luminous item in either hand. Default: ON.
option.XON_CLOUD_LIGHTING=Vanilla Cloud Lighting
option.XON_CLOUD_LIGHTING.comment=Applies time-of-day sunlight and storm shading when using Vanilla Clouds mode.
option.XON_BRIGHTNESS=Overall Brightness
option.XON_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts overall scene exposure prior to filmic tone mapping. Default: 1.05.
option.XON_WARMTH=Sunlight Warmth
option.XON_WARMTH.comment=Controls the golden warmth of direct sunlight while keeping sky shadows cool and balanced. Default: 0.65.
option.XON_TIME_MOOD=Time-of-Day Mood & Vibe
option.XON_TIME_MOOD.comment=Gives distinct atmospheric color, sky, void, and lighting moods to Early Morning (rose-cyan), Noon (crisp cobalt), Warm Afternoon (honey-gold), Evening Sunset (amber-violet), and Night. Default: 100%.
value.XON_TIME_MOOD.0.00=0% (Classic Neutral)
value.XON_TIME_MOOD.0.50=50% (Subtle Mood)
value.XON_TIME_MOOD.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_TIME_MOOD.1.25=125% (Expressive)
value.XON_TIME_MOOD.1.50=150% (Dramatic)
option.XON_DARK_LIFT=Dark Area & Cave Visibility
option.XON_DARK_LIFT.comment=Controls Photon-style cool atmospheric shadow fill in zero-skylight areas (under giant trees, overhangs, and caves) so dark areas are never pitch black. Does not affect bright areas. Default: 100%.
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.0.50=50% (Deep Dark)
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.0.75=75% (Moody)
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.1.25=125% (Bright Shade)
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.1.50=150% (High Visibility)
value.XON_DARK_LIFT.1.80=180% (Maximum Lift)
option.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH=Torch & Lantern Warmth
option.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.comment=Adjusts the color temperature of torches, lanterns, and glowstone from neutral ivory (60%) to cozy golden amber (140%). Default: 100%.
value.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.0.60=60% (Neutral Ivory)
value.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.0.80=80% (Soft Warm)
value.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.1.00=100% (Default Amber)
value.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.1.20=120% (Cozy Gold)
value.XON_BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.1.40=140% (Deep Candlelight)
option.XON_WATER_DETAIL=3-Tier Organic Water Waves
option.XON_WATER_DETAIL.comment=Enables rolling wind swell, trochoidal wavelets, capillary surface ripples, and turquoise wave-crest glow. Disable for flat fast water.
value.XON_WATER_DETAIL.0=Off
value.XON_WATER_DETAIL.1=On
option.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT=Water Wave Height
option.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Controls the height and surface choppiness of water waves and crest glow. Default: 100%.
value.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.0.50=50% (Calm)
value.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.0.75=75% (Gentle)
value.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.1.25=125% (Lively)
value.XON_WAVE_HEIGHT.1.50=150% (Choppy)
option.XON_FOG_AMOUNT=Horizon & Border Fog Density
option.XON_FOG_AMOUNT.comment=Controls how smoothly distant chunks at your render distance edge blend into the horizon sky, plus underwater/Nether fog density. Default: 1.00.
option.XON_RENDER_MODE=Render Resolution Mode
option.XON_RENDER_MODE.comment=Native (100%) renders at full display resolution. Boost 85% and 75% shade world pixels at a lower resolution and reconstruct with Contrast-Adaptive Sharpening for higher FPS on GPU-bound systems.
value.XON_RENDER_MODE.0=Native - 100% Full Resolution
value.XON_RENDER_MODE.1=Boost Quality - 85% Scale
value.XON_RENDER_MODE.2=Boost Performance - 75% Scale
option.XON_SHADOWS=Sun & Moon Cast Shadows
option.XON_SMOOTH_SHADOW_LOD=Smooth Shadow Transitions
option.XON_SMOOTH_SHADOW_LOD.comment=Smooths changes in shadow softness at 20 and 42 blocks while moving. Uses the same sample limits, but extra filtering math can cost GPU time. Default: OFF for maximum performance.
option.XON_SHADOWS.comment=Real directional cast shadows with hardware-PCF softening and synchronized waving foliage shadows. Biggest GPU cost; disable for maximum FPS.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Map Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Controls cast shadow sharpness. 1024 is the high-FPS default; 1536 or 2048 sharpens shadows on large builds at a higher GPU cost.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=Maximum distance (in blocks) where real cast shadows render before blending smoothly into skylight. Default: 96 blocks.
option.XON_LIGHT_SHAFTS=Localized Sun Rays
option.XON_LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Half-resolution volumetric sunbeams near the sun when occluded by clouds, trees, or builds. Requires Shadows ON.
option.XON_EMISSIVE_ORES=Glowing Ore & Crystal Veins
option.XON_EMISSIVE_ORES.comment=Makes diamond, emerald, redstone, gold, lapis, copper, quartz, and royal purple amethyst crystals glow in caves and builds.
option.XON_ORE_GLOW=Ore Glow Brightness
option.XON_ORE_GLOW.comment=Controls the emission intensity of glowing ore veins and crystals. Default: 1.25.
option.XON_COLORED_EMISSIVE_LIGHTING=Colored Emissive Lighting
option.XON_COLORED_EMISSIVE_LIGHTING.comment=Ores cast colored light onto nearby walls and floors; quartz casts soft violet light without recoloring its surface. Works in all three dimensions. Uses a small local voxel volume; disable for maximum FPS.
option.XON_EMISSIVE_RADIUS=Emissive Light Radius
option.XON_EMISSIVE_RADIUS.comment=Base extent of colored light, plus three extra open blocks of softly eased aura. Default: 4 + 3 blocks; adjustable base up to 5. Walls block propagation; corners shorten the reach.
option.XON_EMISSIVE_INTENSITY=Emissive Light Brightness
option.XON_EMISSIVE_INTENSITY.comment=Overall brightness of colored light cast onto nearby surfaces. Default: 1.00.
option.XON_BLOOM=Soft Light Bloom
option.XON_BLOOM.comment=Adds a gentle half-resolution atmospheric glow around bright lanterns, lava fissures, and glowing ores. Default: ON.
option.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Intensity
option.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the strength of the soft glow halo around bright light sources. Default: 100%.
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.0.50=50% (Subtle)
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.0.75=75% (Soft)
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.1.25=125% (Luminous)
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.1.50=150% (Dreamy)
value.XON_BLOOM_STRENGTH.2.00=200% (Intense)
option.XON_REFRACTION=Underwater Refraction & Absorption
option.XON_REFRACTION.comment=Refracts underwater terrain through moving water waves with realistic depth-based color absorption. Disable to save one half-res copy pass.
option.XON_COLOR_GRADE=XON Filmic Color Grade
option.XON_COLOR_GRADE.comment=Applies XON's custom 16-cube 3D LUT for balanced warm highlights and clean shadow tones. Default: ON.
option.XON_GRADE_STRENGTH=Color Grade Strength
option.XON_GRADE_STRENGTH.comment=Blends between neutral tone mapping (0.00) and the full XON color grade LUT (1.00). Default: 0.85.
option.XON_CLOUD_STYLE=Sky Cloud Style
option.XON_CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Selects between XON's 3D Perlin-Worley cumulus + cirrus sky dome (Default) or standard Vanilla clouds.
value.XON_CLOUD_STYLE.0=Vanilla Clouds
value.XON_CLOUD_STYLE.1=Fantasy 3D Cumulus & Cirrus
option.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY=Cloud Coverage & Fluffiness
option.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts how much of the sky is covered by fluffy 3D cumulus clouds. Default: 100%.
value.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.0.60=60% (Light & Airy)
value.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.0.80=80% (Scattered)
value.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.1.20=120% (Fluffy & Full)
value.XON_CLOUD_DENSITY.1.40=140% (Dense Deck)
option.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH=Moving Ground Cloud Shadows
option.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.comment=Soft cloud shadows and broad sun/moon openings, typically 30-50 blocks across. Wind drifts one block every two seconds as shapes join and separate. Cool blue moonlit openings receive up to 28% extra light. Set to 0% to disable. Default: 100%.
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.0.00=Off (0%)
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.0.50=50% (Subtle)
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.0.75=75% (Soft)
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.1.25=125% (Pronounced)
value.XON_GROUND_SHADOW_STRENGTH.1.50=150% (Strong)
option.XON_END_AURORA=End Dimension Aurora Glow
option.XON_END_AURORA.comment=Controls the intensity of the flowing cosmic purple and magenta aurora ribbons in The End sky. Default: 100%.
value.XON_END_AURORA.0.00=Off (Dark Void)
value.XON_END_AURORA.0.50=50% (Subtle)
value.XON_END_AURORA.1.00=100% (Default)
value.XON_END_AURORA.1.35=135% (Vibrant)
value.XON_END_AURORA.1.75=175% (Cosmic Brilliance)
option.XON_ANISOTROPIC=Anisotropic Surface Filtering
option.XON_ANISOTROPIC.comment=Extra grazing-angle filtering for nearby floors and roads. Built-in edge smoothing and distant mip stabilization stay active at every setting. Levels: Off, 2x (Default), 4x, and 6x.
value.XON_ANISOTROPIC.0=Off
value.XON_ANISOTROPIC.2=2x (Default)
value.XON_ANISOTROPIC.4=4x
value.XON_ANISOTROPIC.6=6x (Ultra)
option.XON_BLOCK_OUTLINE=Block Selection Outline
option.XON_BLOCK_OUTLINE.comment=Choose Black or an eight-color rotating Rainbow outline with eased transitions, half-speed rotation and thicker selection lines.
value.XON_BLOCK_OUTLINE.0=Black Outline
value.XON_BLOCK_OUTLINE.1=Rainbow Outline
option.XON_AIR_FOG=Near-Field Atmospheric Haze
option.XON_AIR_FOG.comment=OFF by default so near and mid-range air stays crystal-clear (chunk-border horizon fog is always active). Enable if you also want soft atmospheric mist close to the player.
option.XON_AO_STRENGTH=Ambient Occlusion & Cavity Depth
option.XON_AO_STRENGTH.comment=Controls architectural recess and corner shading depth on builds and terrain. Default: 1.00.
option.XON_WAVING_FOLIAGE=Waving Plants & Leaves
option.XON_WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Synchronized vertex-stage wind sway on leaves, grass, wheat, crops, and vines (and their cast shadows) within 40 blocks.
option.XON_CAUSTICS=Underwater Light Caustics
option.XON_CAUSTICS.comment=Animated sunlight caustic patterns dancing across underwater terrain and submerged blocks.

option.XON_UNDERWATER_RAYS=Underwater God Rays
option.XON_UNDERWATER_RAYS.comment=Restrained blue sunlight scattered through real shadow-map openings. Requires Localized Sun Rays and Shadows. Default: ON. Twelve hoisted shadow-map intervals with translucent look-through and marine absorption; no animated volume noise.
option.XON_RAY_STRENGTH=God Ray Intensity
option.XON_RAY_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of outdoor and underwater sun shafts. Default: 1.00. Set to zero to remove shafts.
option.XON_SUN_STRENGTH=Direct Sunlight Strength
option.XON_SUN_STRENGTH.comment=Direct sun/moon surface lighting. Default: 0.80, 20% lower than 1.0.3.3. Ambient shadow fill is preserved.
option.XON_LOCAL_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Torch and Held Light Strength
option.XON_LOCAL_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Local block and held light intensity. Default: 0.80, 20% lower than 1.0.3.3. Preserves warm color and light falloff.
